  "published": "2026-10-27T20:32:07.76Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "A feature release, backward compatible with 1.2.0. The library moves to Avalonia 12.1.4, so its Avalonia and Avalonia.Themes.Fluent dependencies now start at 12.1.4, and it gains a companion package released at the same version: Enigma.Avalonia.Mobile, which ships this library's palette, the same colour and brush keys with the same values in Dark and Light, for Avalonia mobile applications. No API changes, no theme key renamed, removed or re-valued, and the target frameworks stay net8.0 and net10.0. See RELEASENOTES.md for the full details.",
